flowchart TD
  classDef event fill:#e8f0fe,stroke:#1a73e8,color:#102a43
  classDef safe fill:#e6f4ea,stroke:#188038,color:#102a43
  classDef gate fill:#fef7e0,stroke:#b06000,color:#4a2c00
  classDef write fill:#fce8e6,stroke:#c5221f,color:#4a1010
  classDef stop fill:#f1f3f4,stroke:#5f6368,color:#202124

  start[Issue, PR, review, comment, dispatch, or schedule event]:::event
  start --> kind{Event family}:::gate

  kind -->|PR lifecycle| prctx{Same repository, supported action, and non-draft route?}:::gate
  prctx -->|no| prskip[Ignore or record no-op state]:::stop
  prctx -->|yes| filter{Affected surface?}:::gate
  filter -->|automation or policy| surface[Workflow-surface policy and peer-review route]:::safe
  filter -->|source/test/docs| gates[Repository gates, path checks, and advisory controls]:::safe

  kind -->|Issue or comment| issuectx{Trusted actor, repository association, and explicit supported trigger?}:::gate
  issuectx -->|no| issuereject[No execution; untrusted content remains data]:::stop
  issuectx -->|yes| command{Authorized label or marker command?}:::gate
  command -->|no| triage[Bounded triage or advisory analysis route]:::safe
  command -->|yes| capability{Within accepted agent/provider capability?}:::gate
  capability -->|no| capabilityhold[Status-only diagnostic or separate acceptance hold]:::stop
  capability -->|yes| agent[Per-issue concurrency, trusted prompt boundary, bounded agent route]:::safe

  kind -->|Review/provider evidence| evidence{Current SHA, exact cycle, and accepted evidence type?}:::gate
  evidence -->|no| stale[Status-only evidence; do not complete current cycle]:::stop
  evidence -->|yes| advance[Advance bounded orchestration state]:::safe

  kind -->|Manual dispatch or schedule| control{Inputs allowlisted and workflow capability chartered?}:::gate
  control -->|no| controlhold[Fail closed]:::stop
  control -->|yes| lane[Read-only report, bounded dispatch, or fixed-scope reconciler]:::safe

  surface --> terminal{Result}:::gate
  gates --> terminal
  triage --> terminal
  agent --> terminal
  advance --> terminal
  lane --> terminal
  terminal -->|success or advisory| visible[Summary, check, artifact, or reviewable record]:::safe
  terminal -->|wait or cooldown| pending[Visible pending state; bounded retry only]:::gate
  terminal -->|writer preconditions met| writer[Fixed target, provenance, postcondition, rollback boundary]:::write
  terminal -->|required failure| stop[Stop and surface actionable evidence]:::stop
